WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.015
The complete thesis.

00:00:01.965 --> 00:00:04.875
What two hundred and fifty pages prove.

00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:08.852
This is the definitive statement of the TENET5 investigation.

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:19.056
Two hundred and fifty pages of evidence, sourced from official government records, court decisions, parliamentary Hansard, Auditor General reports, and peer-reviewed academic research.

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:21.374
Every claim is verifiable.

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.454
Every source is cited.

00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:25.818
The thesis has three parts.

00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:32.090
Part one: Canadian institutions have been systematically captured by the interests they were designed to constrain.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:36.624
Part two: Canadian sovereignty has been surrendered across eight dimensions.

00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:45.943
Part three: every Canadian is both the victim and the financial hostage of the captured system through pension fund dependence, housing financialization, and debt servicing.

00:00:45.943 --> 00:00:48.943
The system is self-reinforcing by design.

00:00:48.943 --> 00:00:52.749
Reform threatens the retirement savings of the people it harms.

00:00:52.749 --> 00:00:55.306
This is the architecture of capture.
